      "nlohmann/json (JSON serialization)",
      "jwt-cpp (JWT authentication)",
      "Redis++ (response caching, pub/sub asset invalidation)",
      "spdlog (structured logging)",
      "Prometheus-cpp (metrics & monitoring)",
